        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia questioned whether the petitioner was entitled to a finding of aggravation rather than mitigation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3fdafb0fa4d25aaf69b402f76e484de4cbe470dcde250a5913e7581f6d545206",
