            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked whether Florida advisory\u2011jury findings that would make a defendant eligible for death are covered by this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3fdafb0fa4d25aaf69b402f76e484de4cbe470dcde250a5913e7581f6d545206",
